Description: macOS-inspired desktop interface for Xfce on X11
 Pear provides a menu bar, glass dock, widgets, application launcher,
 local search and Control Center. Includes the maintainer-provided pear logo.
 .
 Experimental package for Debian/Ubuntu-based Xfce systems. Run pear-setup
 as your normal user in an Xfce X11 session after package installation.
 Initial desktop setup downloads external themes and may request sudo.
 Run pear-reset in your user session before removing this package.
